WHAT THIS PROGRAM IS, AND WHAT IT IS NOT

Timbre hosts no audio. It is a shell around other services' own players: audio
streams from the service it belongs to, through that service's player, so their ads
run and artists are paid exactly as they would be otherwise. Nothing is downloaded,
cached, proxied or re-hosted.

Anything built on this that changes that is not this project, and the name should
not travel with it.
